{"posts":[{"id":"3drive_p6_126","t":"Here is my first try at the 3 drive, comments are welcome please let me know if i have done them correctly or not. thanks","a":"sassofrass","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#126","p":6,"im":["80b3306e75decd3383c0862cf764e3bbaf88de73","3444331c76ff6dd696df00a5d058f47e20793936","4a609af9022e347b4bdfbd2800beba2774888ea2","0bbb4c1f69d20cefe378d4cafb7f2e544a02d06a","f4333c96161f4a24536723c87ce5894945563ac6","2772547850be820119eece5c0e508a192ba7f078"],"fa":"این اولین تلاش من با 3 Drive است؛ نظرات را با کمال میل می‌پذیرم، لطفاً بگویید درست انجامشان داده‌ام یا نه. ممنون","ib":{"80b3306e75decd3383c0862cf764e3bbaf88de73":1,"3444331c76ff6dd696df00a5d058f47e20793936":1,"4a609af9022e347b4bdfbd2800beba2774888ea2":1,"0bbb4c1f69d20cefe378d4cafb7f2e544a02d06a":1,"f4333c96161f4a24536723c87ce5894945563ac6":1,"2772547850be820119eece5c0e508a192ba7f078":1},"m":126},{"id":"3drive_p6_127","t":"good stuff here guys\n\ni also found these to be of great help when looking for 3D\n\nok, now you know why IF use blue/red candles","a":"Harry","d":"","r":"Master Trader","n":"#127","p":6,"im":["53f6eff05ce2f8ef1c33dcb68d1ecd58fc05e028"],"fa":"کارهای خوبی است بچه‌ها\n\nمن هم موقع پیدا کردن 3D اینها را خیلی کمک‌کننده یافتم\n\nخب، حالا می‌دانید چرا IF از کندل‌های آبی/قرمز استفاده می‌کند","ib":{"53f6eff05ce2f8ef1c33dcb68d1ecd58fc05e028":2},"m":127},{"id":"3drive_p6_128","t":"Here is a recent 3D play","a":"sassofrass","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#128","p":6,"im":["f7c4b430c3ba8b9cc590fb6cbbe2536c58fcec6c"],"fa":"این یک معاملهٔ 3D اخیر است","ib":{"f7c4b430c3ba8b9cc590fb6cbbe2536c58fcec6c":1},"m":128},{"id":"3drive_p6_129","t":"Here are a few more, thanks sasso","a":"sassofrass","d":"","r":"Trader","n":"#129","p":6,"im":["82eafdb94ef873de2c5401cef1bc1943dbd6784e","9e4359c33b99cff725bc57b7962e0c8d21888635","48c837a3b942784e2ba9364702748dd47e58b4af"],"fa":"چند نمونهٔ دیگر هم هست، ممنون sasso","ib":{"82eafdb94ef873de2c5401cef1bc1943dbd6784e":1,"9e4359c33b99cff725bc57b7962e0c8d2188863